Description: A MODIFIED COPY of 'gsm.datasim' 2.1.0, kept at
    <https://github.com/jwildfire/gsm.datasim> (branch safety-results-2.1)
    for 'study.builder'. It is not Gilead's release: a study design, study
    options, a study profile and study results were added by Jeremy
    Wildfire in November 2026 and have not been raised with, reviewed by
    or endorsed by the package's authors. Changed files carry a notice.
    The original: generates synthetic clinical trial data for testing and
    development of clinical monitoring applications. Produces configurable
    multi-snapshot longitudinal datasets across SDTM-style and custom
    domains, with optional analytics and reporting pipelines powered by
    the 'workr' workflow engine.
